---
import { type GameEntry } from '~/lib/games';

interface Props { game: GameEntry; }
const { game } = Astro.props;
const officialUrl = game.data.officialUrl!;
---

<div class="dirtbound-page -mx-4 -my-8">
  <section class="db-hero"><div class="db-shell db-hero-grid"><div class="db-hero-copy"><nav class="db-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/games/">Game Guides</a><span>/</span><span>DirtBound</span></nav><p class="db-eyebrow">THE PLAYER COMPANION <span>01 / 01</span></p><p class="db-tag">FREE BROWSER RALLY</p><h1>DirtBound <small>– Play Online, Controls &amp; Tips</small></h1><p class="db-intro">A free browser rally game with winding dirt roads, timed challenges, multiplayer racing and a track editor. Find the game, learn the controls and start chasing a faster time.</p><ul class="db-perks"><li>Free to play</li><li>No download</li><li>Desktop &amp; mobile</li></ul><div class="db-actions"><a class="db-button" href={officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Play on Official Site <span>↗</span></a><a class="db-text-link" href="#controls">See Controls ↓</a></div><p class="db-note">Unofficial player guide. The official game opens in a new tab.</p></div><figure class="db-hero-art"><img src="/images/games/dirtbound/rally-stage.jpg" width="659" height="664" alt="Official DirtBound gameplay showing a rally car waiting at the start of a generated stage" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>Official DirtBound gameplay · generated stage start</figcaption></figure></div></section>

  <div class="db-shell db-quick-wrap"><nav class="db-quick-nav" aria-label="On this page"><span>JUMP TO</span><a href="#controls">Controls</a><a href="#modes">Game Modes</a><a href="#penalties">Penalties</a><a href="#tips">Drive Faster</a><a href="#editor">Track Editor</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></nav></div>

  <section id="controls" class="db-section db-shell"><header class="db-heading"><p>01 / GET MOVING</p><h2>DirtBound Controls</h2><span>New to the game? Here are the controls you’ll actually need.</span></header><div class="db-control-grid"><article class="db-panel"><div class="db-panel-title"><h3>Desktop</h3><span>KEYBOARD</span></div><div class="db-keyboard" role="img" aria-label="Keyboard layout highlighting W, A, S and D"><div><kbd>W</kbd></div><div><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd></div><div><kbd class="db-space">SPACE</kbd></div></div><dl class="db-key-list"><div><dt>W / ↑</dt><dd>Accelerate</dd></div><div><dt>S / ↓</dt><dd>Brake / Reverse</dd></div><div><dt>A / D</dt><dd>Steer</dd></div><div><dt>Space</dt><dd>Handbrake</dd></div><div><dt>C</dt><dd>Change camera</dd></div><div><dt>R</dt><dd>Reset (+5s)</dd></div><div><dt>Esc</dt><dd>Pause</dd></div></dl></article><article class="db-panel"><div class="db-panel-title"><h3>Mobile</h3><span>TOUCH</span></div><div class="db-phone" role="img" aria-label="Phone diagram showing a finger dragging left and right to steer a rally car"><i></i><b></b><em>☝</em></div><p class="db-mobile-copy">Touch and drag to steer.<br /><strong>The car accelerates automatically.</strong></p></article></div></section>

  <section id="modes" class="db-section db-shell"><header class="db-heading"><p>02 / PICK YOUR ROUTE</p><h2>Which DirtBound Mode Should You Play?</h2><span>Start with the experience you want.</span></header><div class="db-mode-grid"><article><img src="/images/games/dirtbound/stage-menu.jpg" width="659" height="664" loading="lazy" alt="Official DirtBound Stage setup screen with distance, landscape and theme choices" /><div><small>01 / SOLO RALLY</small><h3>Stage</h3><b>Just want to drive?</b><p>Take on a newly generated rally road. Pick a distance, landscape and season.</p></div></article><article><img src="/images/games/dirtbound/circuit-menu.jpg" width="659" height="664" loading="lazy" alt="Official DirtBound Circuit screen showing selectable tracks and leaderboard" /><div><small>02 / LAP TIME</small><h3>Circuit</h3><b>Want to beat a record?</b><p>Race timed laps, chase the record holder’s ghost and improve your best run.</p></div></article><article><img src="/images/games/dirtbound/daily-menu.jpg" width="659" height="664" loading="lazy" alt="Official DirtBound Daily Challenge screen with a shared stage and leaderboard" /><div><small>03 / SHARED STAGE</small><h3>Daily Challenge</h3><b>Same road, new challenge</b><p>Drive the day’s shared stage and see how your time compares.</p></div></article><article><img src="/images/games/dirtbound/multiplayer-menu.jpg" width="659" height="664" loading="lazy" alt="Official DirtBound Multiplayer screen with Classic and Experimental choices" /><div><small>04 / TOGETHER</small><h3>Multiplayer</h3><b>Race with friends</b><p>Join a public lobby or create a private room to race together.</p></div></article></div><p class="db-extra"><strong>Also in the game:</strong> Experimental adds power-ups to multiplayer. The Track Editor lets you create and share circuits.</p></section>

  <section id="penalties" class="db-section db-shell"><header class="db-heading"><p>03 / WATCH THE CLOCK</p><h2>Why Did I Get a Time Penalty?</h2><span>Two mistakes can change a run quickly.</span></header><div class="db-penalty-grid"><article><div class="db-penalty-art"><span>OFF THE DIRT</span></div><div><b>+5s</b><h3>Off Track or Reset</h3><p>Go off the road, get stuck or press R to reset your car, and five seconds are added to your time.</p></div></article><article><div class="db-penalty-art db-crowd"><span>CROWD ZONE</span></div><div><b>+10s</b><h3>Spectator Hit</h3><p>Hit a spectator and ten seconds are added to your time.</p></div></article></div><p class="db-callout">Clean driving matters. A small mistake can cost more time than you gained by pushing harder.</p></section>

  <section id="tips" class="db-section db-shell"><header class="db-heading"><p>04 / FIND YOUR PACE</p><h2>Trying to Beat Your Best Time?</h2><span>Three practical things to try on your next run.</span></header><div class="db-tips-grid"><article><div class="db-tip-art">BRAKE <span>EXIT ↗</span></div><div><small>01</small><h3>Keep sliding wide?</h3><p>Brake before the bend, then accelerate as you exit.</p></div></article><article><div class="db-tip-art db-grass">DIRT ✓ <span>GRASS SLOWS</span></div><div><small>02</small><h3>Losing time off-road?</h3><p>Stay on the dirt. Grass slows you down, and a reset costs five seconds.</p></div></article><article><div class="db-tip-art db-url">COPY STAGE URL <span>↻ REPLAY</span></div><div><small>03</small><h3>Want to retry the same stage?</h3><p>Save the stage URL and reopen it to drive the same generated road again.</p></div></article></div><p class="db-subnote">Driving tips are general rally advice, not tested DirtBound lap-time claims.</p></section>

  <section id="editor" class="db-section db-shell"><header class="db-heading"><p>05 / MAKE A ROUTE</p><h2>Want to Build Your Own DirtBound Track?</h2><span>Create a rally circuit, test your route and publish it for other players.</span></header><div class="db-editor"><img src="/images/games/dirtbound/editor-route.jpg" width="659" height="664" loading="lazy" alt="Official DirtBound Circuit Editor showing a route drawn with editable track points" /><div><b>CREATE → TEST → PUBLISH</b><p>Shape a circuit in DirtBound’s editor, try it in the game, then publish it for other players. Publishing uses an account.</p><a class="db-outline" href={officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open DirtBound ↗</a></div></div></section>

  <section id="faq" class="db-section db-shell db-faq"><header class="db-heading"><p>06 / QUICK ANSWERS</p><h2>Questions You Might Have While Playing</h2><span>Open the question that matches what just happened.</span></header><div class="db-faq-list">{game.data.faq?.map((item) => <details><summary>{item.question}</summary><p>{item.answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
</div>

<style>
  .dirtbound-page{--db-paper:#fbf7f2;--db-card:#fffdf9;--db-ink:#181c20;--db-muted:#646b68;--db-line:#e8ddd0;--db-orange:#df5b13;--db-dark:#ad3e09;--db-soft:#fff0e3;background:var(--db-paper);color:var(--db-ink);font:16px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;padding-bottom:5rem}.dirtbound-page *{box-sizing:border-box}.dirtbound-page img{display:block;max-width:100%}.db-shell{width:min(1240px,calc(100% - 48px));margin-inline:auto}.db-hero{background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 28%,#f6e0cd 0,transparent 36%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--db-line)}.db-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;align-items:center;gap:42px;min-height:580px;padding-block:32px 40px}.db-crumbs{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px;font-size:12px;color:#6c716e}.db-crumbs a{color:inherit}.db-eyebrow,.db-heading>p,.db-mode-grid small{margin:0 0 11px;color:var(--db-dark);font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em}.db-eyebrow span{float:right;color:#a8a29b}.db-tag{display:inline-block;margin:0 0 14px;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--db-orange);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.db-hero h1{margin:0 0 21px;font-size:clamp(44px,5.15vw,75px);line-height:.99;letter-spacing:-.065em}.db-hero h1 small{display:block;margin-top:13px;font-size:clamp(23px,2.3vw,36px);line-height:1.13}.db-intro{max-width:550px;color:#424b4b;line-height:1.75}.db-perks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;padding:0;margin:0 0 28px;list-style:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:650}.db-perks li:before{content:'✓';margin-right:8px;color:#426646}.db-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px}.db-button,.db-outline{display:inline-flex;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:800}.db-button{background:var(--db-orange);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 0 #a84712}.db-text-link{color:var(--db-ink);font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.db-note{color:#81817e;font-size:11px}.db-hero-art{position:relative;margin:0}.db-hero-art img{width:100%;max-height:520px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px #71583c25}.db-hero-art figcaption{position:absolute;bottom:18px;left:17px;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:#1b2d2c9c;color:#fff;font-size:10px}.db-quick-wrap{position:relative;margin-top:-19px}.db-quick-nav{display:flex;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--db-line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--db-card);box-shadow:0 10px 30px #514d4212;white-space:nowrap}.db-quick-nav>*{flex:0 0 auto;padding:15px 23px;border-right:1px solid var(--db-line);font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.db-quick-nav span{color:var(--db-orange);font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em}.db-section{padding-top:76px}.db-heading{margin-bottom:27px}.db-heading h2{margin:0 0 9px;font-size:clamp(29px,3vw,43px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.052em}.db-heading>span{color:var(--db-muted);font-size:14px}.db-control-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:18px}.db-panel,.db-mode-grid article,.db-penalty-grid article,.db-tips-grid article,.db-editor,.db-faq-list details{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--db-line);border-radius:15px;background:var(--db-card)}.db-panel{padding:24px 26px}.db-panel-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.db-panel-title h3{margin:0;font-size:17px}.db-panel-title span{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#92928b}.db-keyboard{display:grid;justify-content:center;gap:4px;padding:22px 8px 15px}.db-keyboard div{display:flex;gap:5px;justify-content:center}.db-keyboard kbd{display:grid;width:44px;height:42px;place-items:center;border:1px solid #e96d22;border-bottom:3px solid #bb4b0a;border-radius:7px;background:#fff2e6;color:var(--db-dark);font-weight:800}.db-keyboard .db-space{width:191px;height:29px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em}.db-key-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 20px;margin:0}.db-key-list div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid #eee8e0;font-size:12px}.db-key-list dd{margin:0;color:#4d5553;text-align:right}.db-phone{position:relative;width:128px;height:198px;margin:20px auto;border:7px solid #424a4d;border-radius:25px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(#d6e7e8 45%,#8da970 46%)}.db-phone i{position:absolute;left:20px;bottom:-37px;width:75px;height:130px;background:#d9a573;transform:rotate(16deg)}.db-phone b{position:absolute;bottom:30px;left:45px;width:24px;height:35px;border:3px solid #474b48;border-radius:7px;background:#f8f5eb}.db-phone em{position:absolute;right:7px;bottom:23px;font-size:33px}.db-mobile-copy{text-align:center;color:#4c5451;font-size:13px}.db-mode-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px}.db-mode-grid img{width:100%;height:175px;object-fit:cover}.db-mode-grid article>div{padding:18px 18px 21px}.db-mode-grid h3{margin:8px 0 3px;font-size:22px}.db-mode-grid b,.db-mode-grid p{font-size:12px}.db-mode-grid p{margin-bottom:0;color:#59615d}.db-extra,.db-callout{padding:12px 18px;border-radius:9px;background:#f2ede5;border:1px solid #e6dfd4;color:#565d59;font-size:12px}.db-penalty-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.db-penalty-grid article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45% 55%;min-height:215px}.db-penalty-art{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#c5c994,#6d915e)}.db-penalty-art:before{position:absolute;content:'';top:32%;left:-25%;width:140%;height:92px;background:#c89262;transform:rotate(-18deg);border-block:7px solid #e8bd83}.db-penalty-art span{position:absolute;bottom:15px;left:15px;z-index:1;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#263a30a8;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.13em}.db-crowd:before{transform:rotate(15deg)}.db-penalty-grid article>div:last-child{padding:24px}.db-penalty-grid b{color:var(--db-orange);font-size:46px;letter-spacing:-.06em}.db-penalty-grid h3{margin:10px 0 6px;font-size:18px}.db-penalty-grid p{margin:0;color:#58615b;font-size:12px}.db-callout{margin-top:16px;background:#fff4e9;border-left:3px solid var(--db-orange)}.db-tips-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:17px}.db-tip-art{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;height:180px;padding:16px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#c8ce9a,#90ac7b);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em}.db-tip-art span{align-self:flex-start}.db-grass{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#c8ce9a,#7d997e)}.db-url{background:linear-gradient(#c6dce5,#d8c29c)}.db-tips-grid article>div:last-child{padding:20px 22px 24px}.db-tips-grid small{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--db-orange);color:#fff;font-weight:850}.db-tips-grid h3{margin:10px 0 7px;font-size:17px}.db-tips-grid p{margin:0;color:#5a625c;font-size:12px}.db-subnote{color:#898982;font-size:11px}.db-editor{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.22fr .78fr;min-height:310px}.db-editor img{width:100%;height:100%;min-height:310px;object-fit:cover}.db-editor>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding:40px 38px}.db-editor>div>b{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.035em}.db-editor p{color:#606761;line-height:1.75}.db-outline{border:1px solid var(--db-orange);color:var(--db-dark);background:#fff8ef}.db-faq{padding-bottom:0}.db-faq-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 16px;align-items:start}.db-faq-list summary{position:relative;padding:15px 47px 15px 17px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.db-faq-list summary:after{position:absolute;right:17px;content:'+';color:var(--db-orange);font-size:24px}.db-faq-list details[open] summary:after{content:'−'}.db-faq-list p{padding:0 17px 17px;margin:0;color:#58615b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:980px){.db-hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.db-mode-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.db-penalty-grid article{grid-template-columns:1fr}.db-penalty-art{height:165px}.db-editor{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:700px){.db-shell{width:min(100% - 32px,540px)}.db-hero-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:27px;min-height:0;padding-block:22px 38px}.db-hero h1{font-size:clamp(45px,12vw,65px)}.db-hero-art{width:100%}.db-hero-art img{aspect-ratio:1.34;object-fit:cover}.db-quick-wrap{width:100%;margin-top:0}.db-quick-nav{border-radius:0;border-inline:0}.db-section{padding-top:59px}.db-control-grid,.db-editor,.db-faq-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.db-penalty-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.db-penalty-grid article{grid-template-columns:40% 60%;min-height:175px}.db-tips-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.db-tips-grid article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:42% 58%}.db-tip-art{height:100%;min-height:170px}.db-editor img{min-height:260px}.db-mode-grid img{height:140px}}@media(max-width:420px){.db-mode-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.db-mode-grid article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:42% 58%}.db-mode-grid img{height:100%;min-height:160px}.db-penalty-grid article{grid-template-columns:1fr}.db-penalty-art{height:145px}.db-tips-grid article{grid-template-columns:1fr}.db-tip-art{height:145px}}
</style>
